cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "Brain Connectome Pipeline: Functional Network Topology, Community Structure & Robustness Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python workflow for constructing positive, undirected functional
  brain graphs from validated connectivity matrices or preprocessed regional time
  series, and for analyzing topology, community structure, candidate hubs,
  small-worldness, graph-density sensitivity, and node-removal robustness.
authors:
  - given-names: Isha
    family-names: Vats
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - brain connectomics
  - functional connectivity
  - graph theory
  - network neuroscience
  - reproducible research
